File: DemoDID/index.html
This is the main HTML file that defines the structure of the DemoDID application.
Head Section: Includes the QRCode.js library via CDN for generating QR codes client-side.
Form (#kycForm): A comprehensive form with fields based on prior discussions (e.g., name, ID, biometric data, etc.), all marked as required.
Buttons: 
#saveButton triggers data saving.
#mintButton starts disabled and lights up (via CSS/JavaScript) after saving.
Verification buttons call verifyProof() with different proof types.
#exitButton and "Call DID" button for exiting or interacting with a DID.
Display Areas: 
#nftDisplay shows the DID NFT and QR code after minting.
#verificationResult shows proof verification outcomes.
#serverLog simulates the demo-server-log file as a visible log area.
The <script src="script.js"> at the bottom loads the JavaScript logic.
